Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.09,0:00:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,взятings in миролettaänge Yugi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,King of ki. Yugi-Oh! Kings of ki!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.13,0:01:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure could use my\Nfriends right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.77,0:01:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just prolonging your defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite pathetic, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.93,0:01:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stare at your deck all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a card in there that can\Ntake out my all-powerful Zira the Met.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.13,0:01:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Komori Dragon! Oh, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not strong enough to attack Zira.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.19,0:01:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I play my monster in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.03,0:01:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.03,0:01:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,His deck is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.81,0:01:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a rodent in the\Ngrasp of a rattlesnake,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,little Yugi doesn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.21,0:02:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He may have beaten Bandit\NKeith in Duelist Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but he'll find that dueling me will\Nbe a much more difficult challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I play Shining in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And for my next maneuver...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.15,0:02:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I place this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll unleash its wrath\Nwhen the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, last but not least,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,stop defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.57,0:02:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It forces the card you played in\Ndefense mode to switch to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My Komori dragon is revealed, and since\Nit's now in attack mode, I can destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeer in the match, Jagged Claw attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it will come a new beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,my beginning, for soon I will be the\Nkeeper of that Millennium puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm letting this mind-controlling\Nfreak get his hands on my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, I'll never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm placing a monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your feeble defenses bore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaru, attack with Razor Flare Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also place two\Nmore cards on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.01,0:03:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and switch Zero the Mat to Defense Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Confused?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This move will become\Nclear to you soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.19,0:03:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This card face down,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,then Dark Magician in Defense Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, I play\NMagical Hats to hide him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll have to find my Dark\NMagician in order to attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've seen that\Ncoming. Oh, wait. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll play Magic, Jabber.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yu-Gi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but once I sacrifice a card for my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic Jabber allows me to\Ndisable your magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.27,0:04:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your magical hats\Nand hello to your Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.11,0:04:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, my Dark Magician's\Nexposed and now I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.77,0:04:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,play this it's a magic\Ncard called curse of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,fiend it forces both of\Nour monsters on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to switch from whatever\Nmode they're in to the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,opposite so therefore all\Nmonsters in attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,go into defense mode and\Nvice Virus since i put
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,xera in defense mode before\Nit switches to attack
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:05:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mode now and so does\Nyour Dark Magician, Zira.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.65,0:05:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but now I activate Mirror Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It reflects Zira's\Nattack right back at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll block your reflection\Nwith a little Solemn Judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you block my\NMirror Force reflection?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Solemn Judgment is another of\Nmy rare and powerful cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to give up half of my life\Npoints to use it, But in exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm allowed to remove the\Nlast card my opponent played.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Mirror Force, shatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.43,0:05:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It may have cost me 250 life points,\Nbut that's a small price to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now, little Yugi, I'm one\Nattack away from winning your puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the Millennium Puzzle\Nis beyond those doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But my ring is sensing stronger mystical\Nenergies than it's ever sensed before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:05:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark energies from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.17,0:06:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A dueling arena?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're battling for\Nthe Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, come on, Deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.59,0:06:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll come through for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm placing a magic card face down\Nand a monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret those words, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have gotten this far,\Nbut my patience is growing thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this duel and\Nclaim the power that is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get my Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.99,0:06:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tribute to the Doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's one of the rarest\Nmagic cards in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Very perceptive, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tribute to the doomed is one\Nof my personal favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to annihilate any\Nmonster you have on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Better think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.31,0:07:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the living arrow\Nwhich takes any magic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.31,0:07:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,attack aimed at me and\Nfires it right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.43,0:07:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears the shadow magic energies\NI detect are within Yugi's opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandit Keith is just a puppet under\Nthe control of an evil master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this puppet show is over, for I\Nalone shall possess the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.49,0:07:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring, sever the strings\Nthat bind this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Free his mind from the Shadow Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:08:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium spell over\NKeith has been broken But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.95,0:08:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Only another Millennium item\Ncan sever a connection so strong
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And what on earth am I wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like your so-called unbeatable\NZira the Mad card is ancient history now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time for me to win this duel once and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.65,0:08:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,for all and take back\Nmy Millennium Puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandit Key, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Key, your resistance is pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You belong to me now, so pick up\Nthose cards and win me that puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a good mind slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.99,0:08:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone inside my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Key?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Keith, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.41,0:08:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandit Keith, who is it that's\Ntrying to control your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I must regain my power over this fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever's weakening my control must\Nalso be after the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:09:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not allow someone else to\Ntake what should be rightfully mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.79,0:09:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I lose complete control,\NI've got to destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't have this puzzle, no\None can! No! Keith, wait! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My puzzle! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, no one else shall take my prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya told me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Keith certainly did a number on\Nyour Millennium puzzle, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.75,0:10:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, better shattered\Nthan stolen, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.65,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It took me forever to put\Nit together the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.27,0:10:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but at least I have a chance to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I did it once already,\Nmaybe this time it'll be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And once you've completed it,\NI'll be there to take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to make sure that\Nno one stands in my way again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.35,0:10:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need to manipulate\Na piece of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you're such a naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.23,0:10:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool, you have no idea of the ancient\Npowers the puzzle contains within.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,magical powers that when combined\Nwith the other six millennium items
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,are so incredible whoever possesses\Nthem shall rule the world powers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that will soon belong to me once i\Ncollect all of the items one by one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,my millennium ring will track\Nthem down so i can unlock the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,mystical energies that were imprisoned\Nin these objects long ago in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The age of the Shadow Games, the\NPharaoh and his loyal minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,thought they could banish the power\Nforever by dividing it up among
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the millennium items and hiding\Nthem away but the time has come
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.23,0:11:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,for me to claim them all for\Nmyself and the millennium puzzle is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,no exception ring transfer a\Nportion of my spirit into this piece
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,of the puzzle so that I may be\Nforever near its ultimate power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.25,0:11:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbeknownst to Yugi, a part of me\Nwill be infused within the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,From this one piece,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:12:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to explore the inner chambers\Nof its mystic millennium components,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and one day soon, claim them for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.03,0:12:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you missed this one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.91,0:12:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing I need is to lose\Na piece of the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.03,0:12:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't complete it without them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You totally saved the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.27,0:12:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get back to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right behind you, Bakura,\Nas soon as I unhook my chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Prize, you worthless buffoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the duel is not yet done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.95,0:12:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You could still win the match\Nand claim my Millennium Prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Obey me, and Duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Key, stop! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, someone's playing us for suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,These arrows are like a giant maze
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.51,0:13:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, there's smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone may need our help
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I've got to get my\Npuzzle down and get out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.69,0:13:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use, the chain's just too strong.\NAnd this fire is spreading really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get out those windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.55,0:14:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be all over for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.97,0:14:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And for the spirit of the puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we're here to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get them out of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.51,0:14:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll try to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.31,0:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.15,0:14:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Fit. Fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to finish the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who\Nknows how to solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.43,0:14:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My time's running out, and this fire\Nis getting bigger by the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.31,0:14:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I solve the puzzle, I save the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I don't make it out,\Nat least he will. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, on three. Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.65,0:15:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've almost got it figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, you were knocking\Nthat door like a Girl Scout.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.89,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is haunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, did we just rescue Bandit Keith?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make sure no one else is in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, what are you doing? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't leave yet, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to finish putting\Ntogether the Millennium Puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All this smoke's gone to his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.49,0:15:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This should do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate Dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.19,0:16:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we gotta get out of here fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.59,0:16:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't leave without my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.97,0:16:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.95,0:16:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You go grab Yugi's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, Joey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I got Yugi's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Any luck with that puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.55,0:16:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, why'd he hook it\Nto such a thick chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire, it's spreading!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.95,0:17:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, it's time to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.05,0:17:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't budge, not without the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just gonna have to find\Na way to break this chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's not coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.33,0:17:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the rod in the hole\Nand we'll both pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, on three. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the second floor over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Head him out, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Steady, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.49,0:17:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Boogie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:17:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.27,0:17:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's safe and sound now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And that Millennium Puzzler is his, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, not for nothing,\Nold pal, but let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You and me, we're heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.01,0:18:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the puzzle is safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, so are you, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how can I ever thank you\Nguys for saving my life back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You put yourselves in danger\Nto make sure I would be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the greatest\Nfriends a guy ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what buds are for, right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a good thing I spotted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.11,0:18:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.31,0:18:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my brilliant idea, we were\Nable to pry a puzzle off the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.87,0:18:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.19,0:18:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stick the pole into the hole\Nand then we'll pull on it really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Say nothing. You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, guys, or I won't\Nshare my hospital food with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The important thing is that\Nwe're all safe and back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:18:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.81,0:18:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.89,0:19:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem kind of quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.31,0:19:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have the Jell-O.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad those three are back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, someone's after\NYugi's Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.25,0:19:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of that, I\Nalmost lost him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Yugi first put that puzzle\Ntogether and bonded with the spirit inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone's been trying\Nto get their hands on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But something tells me this time\Nwe're in more danger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.65,0:19:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know we haven't seen the last\Nof whoever it is that's after Yugi!
